cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. Tests use SYNTHETIC fixtures; answer quality is UNRUN (not claimed)."
title: "spark-rag-guardrail: source-grounded RAG with a retrieval-relevance guardrail"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Brisson"
    given-names: "Jean-François"
    affiliation: "Spark AI NLP"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/spark-rag-guardrail"
url: "https://sparkainlpx.xyz"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-27"
abstract: >-
  Source-grounded retrieval-augmented generation (ChromaDB + optional
  sentence-transformers + local Ollama) with a retrieval-relevance guardrail:
  when no retrieved chunk meets the similarity threshold, the LLM is not called
  and an explicit refusal is returned. Research prototype; tests use SYNTHETIC
  fixtures; answer quality and hallucination reduction are UNRUN.
keywords:
  - rag
  - guardrail
  - chromadb
  - ollama
  - research-software
